---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="Corrections policy — Rent Free News" description="Every article shows published and updated dates. Report an error with the link and the primary source; fixes go on top.">
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 py-10 prose dark:prose-invert">
    <h1>Corrections policy</h1>
    <p>We correct fast and visibly. Every article shows Published + Updated dates. Fixes are noted at the top, not silently edited.</p>
    <p>Email <a href="mailto:desk@rentfreenews.com">desk@rentfreenews.com</a> with link + primary source. We reply within 48h and update the Verdict box if needed.</p>
  </div>
</Layout>
